# The build context is the repo root, which also holds _tmp (luna.msstyles and Windows
# Classic.theme copies) and session data: send only what build.Dockerfile copies.
*
!xp-luna-for-mint/build.sh
!xp-luna-for-mint/tools/
!xp-classic-for-mint/build.sh
!xp-classic-for-mint/tools/
!shared/tools/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
